  "prefLabel": "Rev 1204.02 Appeals",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Rev 1204.02 Appeals. Pursuant to RSA 198:60, appeals shall be filed in writing with the New Hampshire board of tax and land appeals within 30 days from the date of the notice of relief or denial, or the notice of assessment after an audit.\n\nSource. #7365, eff 9-19-00; ss by #7910, eff 6-25-03; ss by #9946, eff 6-23-11; ss by #12923, eff 11-26-19",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/rev1200.html"
